{"3343040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Potion & Fortune", "steam_appid": 3343040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>POTION &amp; FORTUNE</strong> places you in the life of a small dwarf alchemist running a dangerous shop in a <strong>medieval town</strong> filled with villagers, merchants, and knights. The world may seem quiet… but it is never <strong>truly safe</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come and go, each with their own needs, secrets, and intentions. Some are honest. Some are desperate. And some… should never be helped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every potion you craft, every deal you accept, shapes more than just your fortune.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Story and Enchanting World</strong> – Meet different customers in a warm yet mysterious medieval town. Choose your decisions carefully, as some may use your potions for good, while others may use them for evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/4d01f943770cfd0352810effc1ebaf9b.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/4d01f943770cfd0352810effc1ebaf9b.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/4d01f943770cfd0352810effc1ebaf9b.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potion Crafting and Trading</strong> – Brew potions with different effects and sell them to the townsfolk. From simple remedies to powerful elixirs, every sale brings you one step closer to rediscovering your lost magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/e1662897d22db1ea7fddaf5b247a8569.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/e1662897d22db1ea7fddaf5b247a8569.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/e1662897d22db1ea7fddaf5b247a8569.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material Hunting and Monster Combat</strong> – Gather resources in rich regions, fight monsters, and explore hidden locations filled with mystical plants and rare minerals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/4e9845800588088ebe0918e4d44fc60c.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/4e9845800588088ebe0918e4d44fc60c.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/4e9845800588088ebe0918e4d44fc60c.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloody Harvest &amp; Perilous Combat</strong> – Venture beyond the safe walls of your shop to gather ingredients and face the monsters lurking in the dark. Don't just defeat them; use your mystical powers to brutally execute them by blowing their heads to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/124c9c6732af7d3262388fb231ac5f35.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/124c9c6732af7d3262388fb231ac5f35.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/124c9c6732af7d3262388fb231ac5f35.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Gnome Hero</strong>: A clever and resilient alchemist struggling to survive in a dangerous world<br>• <strong>Hunting &amp; Combat</strong>: Fight monsters and gather rare materials from dangerous areas<br>• <strong>Potion Crafting System</strong>: Experiment, combine, and discover new recipes<br>• <strong>Customer-Driven Gameplay</strong>: Interpret hints instead of following clear instructions<br>• <strong>Ash-Based Crafting</strong>: Burn materials to unlock advanced potion creation<br>• <strong>Risk &amp; Negotiation</strong>: Take risks for greater rewards<br>• <strong>Moral Choices</strong>: Not every customer can be trusted<br>• <strong>Exploration &amp; Gathering</strong>: Discover hidden resources and locations<br>• <strong>Upgradeable Workshop &amp; Wand</strong>: Grow stronger in both crafting and combat<br>• <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong>: A quiet yet dangerous world <br> <br>Kayıp güçlerini geri kazanıp Potion &amp; Fortune’un büyüsünü kasabaya getirebilecek misin, yoksa mükemmel karışımı bulma arayışında kaybolacak mısın?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.poster.avif?t=1785910612\" width=1170 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.webm?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343040/extras/195d1557b64bb50229e0642f2e510c38.mp4?t=1785910612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>POTION &amp; FORTUNE</strong> places you in the life of a small dwarf alchemist running a dangerous shop in a <strong>medieval town</strong> filled with villagers, merchants, and knights. The world may seem quiet… but it is never <strong>truly safe</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers come and go, each with